{"t":"INTC","made":"2026-11-18 01:51","name":"Intel Corporation","ko":"인텔","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","employees":81100,"hq":"Santa Clara, CA, United States","website":"https://www.intel.com","summary_en":"Intel Corporation designs, develops, manufactures, markets, sells, and services computing and related end products and services in the United States, Ireland, Israel, and internationally. It operates through three segments: CCG, DCAI, and Intel Foundry. The company offers client computing group products, including client and commercial CPUs, discrete client GPUs, edge computing, and connectivity products; data center and AI products, such as server CPUs, discrete GPUs, and networking products; and semiconductors comprising wafer fabrication, substrates, and other related products and services. It also provides driving assistance and self-driving solutions; and develops and manufactures multi-beam mask writing tools. The company sells its products through sales organizations, distributors, resellers, retailers, and OEM partners. It serves original equipment manufacturers, original design manufacturers, cloud service providers, and other manufacturers and service providers. Intel Corporation has a strategic collaboration with Infosys Limited to develop a multi-layer AI fabric that unifies infrastructure, models, data, applications, and workflows into a composable and agent-ready ecosystem. The company was incorporated in 1968 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Intel Corporation은 미국, 아일랜드, 이스라엘 및 국제적으로 컴퓨팅과 관련 최종 제품 및 서비스를 설계, 개발, 제조, 마케팅, 판매 및 서비스합니다. CCG, DCAI 및 Intel Foundry의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 클라이언트 및 상업용 CPU, 개별 클라이언트 GPU, 에지 컴퓨팅 및 연결 제품을 포함한 클라이언트 컴퓨팅 그룹 제품을 제공합니다. 서버 CPU, 개별 GPU 및 네트워킹 제품과 같은 데이터 센터 및 AI 제품; 웨이퍼 제조, 기판, 기타 관련 제품 및 서비스로 구성된 반도체. 또한 운전 보조 및 자율주행 솔루션도 제공합니다. 멀티빔 마스크 필기구를 개발 및 제조하고 있습니다. 회사는 판매 조직, 유통업체, 리셀러, 소매업체 및 OEM 파트너를 통해 제품을 판매합니다. OEM, 독창적인 디자인 제조업체, 클라우드 서비스 제공업체, 기타 제조업체 및 서비스 제공업체에 서비스를 제공합니다. Intel Corporation은 인프라, 모델, 데이터, 애플리케이션 및 워크플로를 구성 가능하고 에이전트 지원 에코시스템으로 통합하는 다계층 AI 패브릭을 개발하기 위해 Infosys Limited와 전략적 협력을 맺고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1968년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 산타클라라에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":53.55,"mcap":284618227712.0,"pe":null,"fpe":29.908514,"peg":null,"ps":4.752191,"pb":2.4744697,"ev_ebitda":16.075,"div":0.0,"beta":2.426,"hi52":142.35,"lo52":32.89},"fin":{"rev":59891998720.0,"rev_g":0.209,"eps_g":-0.327,"gross":0.40152,"op":0.10317001,"net":-0.20089,"roe":-0.0962,"fcf":806499968.0,"cash":54004998144.0,"debt":50133999616.0,"de":38.108,"eps":-2.35,"feps":1.79046},"own":{"short":0.028800001,"inst":0.6873,"insider":0.12909001},"analyst":{"n":43,"mean":90.65116,"median":86.0,"high":160.0,"low":63.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.5102,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":12,"hold":34,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":11,"hold":36,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":14,"hold":32,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":13,"hold":32,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"B of A Securities","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":80.0,"priorPriceTarget":100.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-31","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":80.0,"priorPriceTarget":100.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-31","Firm":"Freedom Broker","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":90.0,"priorPriceTarget":100.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":80.0,"priorPriceTarget":85.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","curren